{"actor": "pilar", "id": 73222, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12710, "offer": {"created_tick": 1439, "expires_tick": 1443, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 66, "types": []}, "id": 20236, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 2210, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1176, "kind": "card", "print_run": 30, "rarity": "rare", "ref": "SAL-09", "serial": 28, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t04", "text": "Qué labia tiene usted, caballero. Pero el mantón no paga las cartas; el dinero sí. Sesenta y seis, 66 P, aquí mismo y en el acto. El Marqués entraría en su álbum esta misma tarde.", "thread": 2210, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.3167, "tick": 1439, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t04", "id": 73225, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12711, "offer": {"created_tick": 1439, "expires_tick": 1443, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 1176, "kind": "card", "print_run": 30, "rarity": "rare", "ref": "SAL-09", "serial": 28, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 20238, "maker": "t04", "status": "open", "thread": 2210, "to": "pilar", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 83, "types": []}}, "sender": "t04", "team": "t04", "text": null, "thread": 2210, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.3167, "tick": 1439, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 73229, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 12712, "offer": {"created_tick": 1440, "expires_tick": 1444, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 69, "types": []}, "id": 20239, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 2210, "to": "t04", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1176, "kind": "card", "print_run": 30, "rarity": "rare", "ref": "SAL-09", "serial": 28, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t04", "text": "Sin rodeos, entonces: 69 P. Cifra honrada, pagada al instante, y El Marqués descansa esta tarde en mi caja fuerte, entre los suyos de Salamanca. No hay palacio mejor en todo Madrid, caballero.", "thread": 2210, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 13.325, "tick": 1440, "type": "thread.message"}
